@startuml

salt
{
  <b>MY ACCESS</b>
  --
  {#
    Signed in as | jdoe
    Tenant | Acme Bank
    Roles I hold | 2
  }
  --
  {#
    Role | Description
    Viewer | Read-only access to domain data
    Trading | Reads reference data and manages trades
  }
  --
  {#
    <b>Ask for a role</b>
    Role | [ Analytics        v ]
    Why I need it | I price the new book and cannot read curves
    [ Ask ]
  }
  --
  {#
    <b>My requests</b>
    Role | State | Answer
    Trading | waiting | -
    Analytics | refused | Not this quarter
  }
  --
  [ Close ]
}

@enduml
